sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Team member
  participant I as Schedule import tab
  participant C as scheduleCsv.ts
  participant DB as sk_matches
  S->>I: choose CSV file (date, time, sport, event, round, side_a, side_b, venue)
  I->>C: parseCsv(text)
  C->>C: match sport/event/faction/venue names to the edition's lookups
  C->>C: check date within edition, time format, sides differ
  C->>C: mark duplicates (same event, time and sides)
  C-->>I: rows with errors / ready / duplicate
  I-->>S: preview table with problems highlighted
  S->>I: Import ready rows
  I->>DB: insert rows (RLS: can_edit_sk)
  DB-->>I: ids
  I-->>S: "Imported N games"
